        }
      }
    },
    "The rate in effect on the transaction date is stored with the record, so later rate changes never alter history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "交易日期当天生效的汇率会与记录一同保存，之后的汇率变化不会改变历史。"
